{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4461a45c00b74b8f6b70d2f677df7010f24306ffc143b36da18ae8e472cca173", "ja": "このみとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "与木实一同出游的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dbbfb660aef1d2bbc2d2d911b797d944d3cd878161709f64c6e83367f4ac49e5", "ja": "（今日はこのみさんとお土産を探しに来ている。\n劇場のみんなには買ったから、あとは……ん？）", "zh": "（今天和木实小姐一起来找伴手礼。剧场里大家的礼物已经买好了，接下来……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon02_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "d08290ae8307ed5a9ea8fd52445005ffb41013bd705e7e92593dd99901500d63", "ja": "うふふ……地酒。\n地酒……い～い響きよね～……♪", "zh": "呵呵呵……当地特产酒。\n当地特产酒……听起来真～棒啊～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0168be3b3b96207801cd4ddcab4b15c8f320d18935d8ad647f5006357de7dd17", "ja": "日本酒ですか、なるほど。秋田は米どころですし、\nお酒も美味しいでしょうね。", "zh": "是日本酒啊，原来如此。秋田盛产稻米，\n酒肯定也很好喝吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon02_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "51a99da40f07109ca4e14b24096102dbdbfd683138b262871359f855070d2c63", "ja": "そうなの！　せっかくだから地元のお酒、\n生酒なんかも試したいのよね～。", "zh": "对呀！难得来一趟，我还想试试当地的酒，比如生酒什么的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon02_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "95dccc5a34b3e7ee92b5262ca5637b608445b90b37579d1ba9d8755a14aa282b", "ja": "これもいいし……こっちは莉緒ちゃんが好きそう……。\nダメ、3本までって決めたのに、6本から絞れないわ！", "zh": "这个也不错……这个感觉莉绪会喜欢……  \n不行，明明说好了最多只能买3瓶，却没法从6瓶里挑出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "485bab61c178dfaa7ef2cd74312988fb59b1b2169816e8e061606bc6cd0f4eb6", "ja": "そうですね……だったら6本、まとめていきましょう！\n任せてください！", "zh": "没错……既然这样，那就把这6支一起带走吧！\n交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon02_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "d41f9351c79c2aa9a212e0f77649ea9ea50eeb6ec29373b359a8e970370de755", "ja": "えっ！？\nもしかして、{$P$}……。", "zh": "诶！？\n难道说，是{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7e9c411b505095ec50c987e21c178808688fd008939369559b9234ed907c5516", "ja": "このみさんにはいつもお世話になってますから。\nたまには恩返しさせてください。", "zh": "因为一直承蒙您照顾，偶尔也请让我报答一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon02_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "798f4f7494f7a0072adde5b7df205fa29ff799ebb218362e96caaccf039a1b30", "ja": "やだ、素敵……！　{$P$}、\n私が惚れちゃったらどうするのよ！？　もうっ！", "zh": "讨厌啦，太棒了……！{$P$}，\n要是我迷上你了怎么办嘛！？真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
